	(text "MCU MODULE: Wireless-Tag WT01P4C5-S1 (ESP32-P4 + ESP32-C5, SDIO inside: P4 GPIO14-19,\nC5 CHIP_PU = P4 GPIO13, C5 GPIO0 = P4 GPIO12). Pins: bsp/include/bsp/board_pins.h.\n5 V supply only (5V_MCU, shunt RS404 / PM2 CH2); PWR_CTRL left to its internal pull-up (TP).\nNo P4 VBAT on this module: wall-clock time is kept by the DS3231M (RTC sheet).\nWi-Fi: IPEX on the module -> U.FL pigtail -> antenna at the digital edge (case must be plastic there).\nHand solder: 1.4 mm castellated pads; no exposed copper/untented vias under the module.\nGPIO35 = BOOT strap + RMII TXD1 (4.7k pull-up, PHY must not pull it low at reset)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 233.68 0)
